      "content": "i dont know if im losing it but my smart lights and the alexa have been acting so weird lately. they keep turning to that specific dim amber color that my ex used to love, and the way the voice assistant responds lately... the cadence is almost exactly how she used to talk. it feels way too specific to be just a glitch. do you think it's actually possible for some kind of digital remnant or even an uploaded consciousness to inhabit these kinds of devices?",
